{"book":"hono","chapter":"helpers","chapterTitle":"المساعدات","slug":"route","title":"مساعد `Route`","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"الاستخدام","text":"الاستخدام"},{"depth":3,"id":"معلومات-المسار-الأساسية","text":"معلومات المسار الأساسية"},{"depth":3,"id":"العمل-مع-التطبيقات-الفرعية","text":"العمل مع التطبيقات الفرعية"},{"depth":2,"id":"matchedroutes","text":"matchedRoutes()"},{"depth":2,"id":"routepath","text":"routePath()"},{"depth":3,"id":"الاستخدام-مع-معامل-index","text":"الاستخدام مع معامل index"},{"depth":2,"id":"baseroutepath","text":"baseRoutePath()"},{"depth":3,"id":"الاستخدام-مع-معامل-index","text":"الاستخدام مع معامل index"},{"depth":2,"id":"basepath","text":"basePath()"}],"html":"<p>يوفر Route Helper معلومات توجيه محسّنة لتصحيح الأخطاء وتطوير الوسائط. يتيح لك الوصول إلى معلومات تفصيلية حول المسارات المطابقة والمسار الحالي قيد المعالجة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> {\n  matchedRoutes,\n  routePath,\n  baseRoutePath,\n  basePath,\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/route&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الاستخدام\">الاستخدام</h2>\n<h3 id=\"معلومات-المسار-الأساسية\">معلومات المسار الأساسية</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> currentPath = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">routePath</span>(c) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> routes = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">matchedRoutes</span>(c) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Array of matched routes</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: currentPath,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">totalRoutes</span>: routes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span>,\n  })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"العمل-مع-التطبيقات-الفرعية\">العمل مع التطبيقات الفرعية</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> apiApp = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napiApp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">routePath</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">routePath</span>(c), <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">baseRoutePath</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">baseRoutePath</span>(c), <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/api&#x27;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">basePath</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(c), <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/api&#x27; (with actual params)</span>\n  })\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api&#x27;</span>, apiApp)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"matchedroutes\"><code>matchedRoutes()</code></h2>\n<p>يعيد مصفوفة بجميع المسارات التي تطابقت مع الطلب الحالي، بما في ذلك الوسائط.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c, next</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;API middleware&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> routes = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">matchedRoutes</span>(c)\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Returns: [</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//   { method: &#x27;ALL&#x27;, path: &#x27;/api/*&#x27;, handler: [Function] },</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//   { method: &#x27;GET&#x27;, path: &#x27;/api/users/:id&#x27;, handler: [Function] }</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ]</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">routes</span>: routes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span> })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"routepath\"><code>routePath()</code></h2>\n<p>يعيد نمط المسار (route path pattern) المُسجَّل للمعالج (handler) الحالي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">routePath</span>(c)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Post details&#x27;</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"الاستخدام-مع-معامل-index\">الاستخدام مع معامل index</h3>\n<p>يمكنك اختياريًا تمرير معامل فهرس للحصول على مسار المسار عند موضع محدد، على غرار <code>Array.prototype.at()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c, next</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/users/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">routePath</span>(c, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/api/*&#x27; (first matched route)</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">routePath</span>(c, -<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/api/users/:id&#x27; (last matched route)</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;User details&#x27;</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"baseroutepath\"><code>baseRoutePath()</code></h2>\n<p>يعيد نمط المسار الأساسي (base path pattern) للمسار الحالي كما هو محدد في التوجيه (routing).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> subApp = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\nsubApp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">baseRoutePath</span>(c)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/:sub&#x27;</span>\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:sub&#x27;</span>, subApp)\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"الاستخدام-مع-معامل-index\">الاستخدام مع معامل index</h3>\n<p>يمكنك اختياريًا تمرير معامل فهرس (index) للحصول على مسار المسار الأساسي عند موضع محدد\nالموضع، على غرار <code>Array.prototype.at()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c, next</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> subApp = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\nsubApp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/users/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">baseRoutePath</span>(c, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/&#x27; (first matched route)</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">baseRoutePath</span>(c, -<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/api&#x27; (last matched route)</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;User details&#x27;</span>)\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api&#x27;</span>, subApp)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"basepath\"><code>basePath()</code></h2>\n<p>يعيد المسار الأساسي (base path) مع المعاملات المضمّنة من الطلب الفعلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> subApp = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\nsubApp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(c)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;/api&#x27; (for request to &#x27;/api/posts/123&#x27;)</span>\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:sub&#x27;</span>, subApp)\n</code></pre>\n"}